    <h4>1. Risk Disclosure</h4>
    <p>Trading forex, futures, stocks, crypto assets and other financial instruments involves substantial financial risk and may not be suitable for everyone. You may lose some or all of the capital you invest.</p>
    <p>You should only trade with amounts whose loss would not endanger your financial security or standard of living. It is entirely your responsibility to assess your financial situation and decide whether trading is appropriate for you.</p>
